      "en": "Then he said to them, “The harvest is indeed plentiful, but the laborers are few. Pray therefore to the Lord of the harvest, that he may send out laborers into his harvest.",
      "ko": "이르시되 추수할 것은 많되 일군이 적으니 그러므로 추수하는 주인에게 청하여 추수할 일군들을 보내어 주소서 하라",
      "source_text_hash": "37d07d6ef257ac424248a0d9d998307f905e7ae2d329f01f30a0929cd6890dcb",
      "translation_text_hash": "525459348ba590c925d669422e3dd5313fe05fb858581f5c16bba35ecce2c8a1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
