      "en": "But into whatever city you enter and they don’t receive you, go out into its streets and say,",
      "ko": "어느 동네에 들어가든지 너희를 영접지 아니하거든 그 거리로 나와서 말하되",
      "source_text_hash": "b9b233e5876d03ecaac34afe6a9550f196e18f9768bb5bd67d4915e9570cee8a",
      "translation_text_hash": "36e1b911b743c639bbf7318da1c3dee0e94d8cb62a404f3229b5feaefc0f2b04",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
