      "en": "‘Even the dust from your city that clings to us, we wipe off against you. Nevertheless know this, that God’s Kingdom has come near to you.’",
      "ko": "너희 동네에서 우리 발에 묻은 먼지도 너희에게 떨어버리노라 그러나 하나님의 나라가 가까이 온줄을 알라 하라",
      "source_text_hash": "2e0dcbf3b5e8cf2cd922c0e0c9cd812f62e3dfbdfba429ef1a396950080c99c4",
      "translation_text_hash": "36c9bfa19bc88b4098ad3e780faeb760815497667ef789a64b8cb62629ea272f",
